                    "payload": "tree 572338ea84cd371af4937648072dd98e86c56581\nparent 483dbbb1ad55c154e4c3d51f36e57ac4a8b73e88\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1792444701 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1792444701 +0000\n\nRemove pulse-line advice that broke C-x o\n\npulse-line is interactive, so advising other-window with it replaced\nother-window's interactive spec with an empty one. C-x o then called\nother-window with no COUNT and failed with \"Wrong number of arguments\".\nThe advised commands already pulse through pulsar in sp-windows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011YYQVRu1Rv32L6sD5UTozk\n",
